@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@adminToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

# Todas las respuestas: { minGroupSize, generatedAt, filters, notes, items[] }
# Celdas por debajo de METRICS_MIN_GROUP: suppressed=true y valores null.
# Cada consulta queda en AuditLog con action=METRICS_VIEWED.

### Rendimiento académico por materia (filtros opcionales, UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/academic-performance?periodId=&careerId=
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Rezago y riesgo por carrera y semestre actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/retention-risk?periodId=&careerId=
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Asistencia por grupo (sin datos de profesor; solo sesiones cerradas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/attendance?periodId=&subjectId=
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Temas del chat (solo consentimiento ANALYTICS de la versión vigente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/chat-topics
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Cuestionarios: kind = ONBOARDING | CHECK_IN | TERM_SURVEY
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/satisfaction?kind=ONBOARDING
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Debe responder 400 (kind inválido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/satisfaction?kind=NOPE
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

# ===========================================================================
# Dashboard de administración (INSTITUTION_ADMIN / ANALYST)
# weeks: 1–52 (por defecto 12). periodId: UUID; sin él, summary y operations usan el periodo en curso.
# ===========================================================================

### Resumen (tarjetas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/dashboard/summary
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Adopción: embudo + activos por semana
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/dashboard/adoption?weeks=12
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Rendimiento: reprobación por materia, histograma, promedio por periodo, recursamiento
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/dashboard/performance
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Avance de créditos por semestre (al corriente / rezago leve / rezago)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/dashboard/progress
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Chat: temas por grupo, consultas por semana, feedback (solo ANALYTICS vigente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/dashboard/chat?weeks=12
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Cuestionarios por pregunta
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/dashboard/questionnaires?kind=ONBOARDING
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Asistencia: semanal global + por materia
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/dashboard/attendance?weeks=12
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Operación: listas de grupo, profesores con cuenta, consentimientos
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/dashboard/operations
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

# ===========================================================================
# Etiquetado manual de temas (solo ANALYST). Lee contenido: todo se audita.
# ===========================================================================

### Catálogo de temas
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/labeling/topics
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Cola: conversaciones elegibles sin etiqueta manual
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/labeling/queue?limit=20
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Etiquetar una conversación
POST {{baseUrl}}/metrics/labeling/CONVERSATION_UUID
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "topicIds": ["TOPIC_UUID"] }

### Quitar una etiqueta puesta por error
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/metrics/labeling/CONVERSATION_UUID/TOPIC_UUID
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Periodos para el selector del panel (marca el que está en curso)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/dashboard/periods
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

# Asistencia: items.bySection = [{ sectionId, subject, groupCode, sessions, students, records, presentRate, lateRate, absentRate, excusedRate }]
# ordenado por materia y grupo, sin profesor.

### Registrar un reporte impreso (REPORT_GENERATED en AuditLog) antes de window.print
# section: full | summary | academic | attendance | chat | suggestions
POST {{baseUrl}}/metrics/reports
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "section": "attendance", "weeks": 12 }

### Etiquetado (solo ANALYST): saltar por reconocer a la persona
POST {{baseUrl}}/metrics/labeling/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/skip
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
